{"strongs": "H5678", "word": "עֶבְרָה", "translit": "ev.rah", "root": "עבץ", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "overflow, arrogance, fury", "definition": "עֶבְרָה noun feminine overflow, arrogance, fury ; — absolute ׳ ע Isa 13:9 +; construct עֶבְרַת Zeph 1:18 +; suffix עֶבְרָתִי Isa 10:6 +, etc.; plural עֲבָרוֺת Job 21:30 construct עַבְרוֺת Ps 7:7 ; Job 40:11 — 1. overflow, excess, outburst , זָדוֺן ׳ ע Prov 21:24 excess of insolence ; עַבְרוֺת אַפֶּ֑ךָ Job 40:11 outbursts of thine anger . 2. arrogance , of Moab Isa 16:6 ( + גַּאֲוָה ), גַּא׃ן hence Jer 48:20 (+ id. v Jer 48:29 ). 3. overflowing rage, fury: \\ \\ a. of men, Gen 49:7 (poem in J ), Amos 1:11 (both || אַף ), Isa 14:6 ; Prov 14:35 , שֵׁבֶט עֶבְרָתוֺ Prov 22:8 (i. e. rod wielded by him in fury, see also Lam 3:1 below), עַבְרוֺת צוֺרְרָ֑י Ps 7:7 the outbursts of fury of my foes \\ \\ b. of ׳ י Hos 5:10 ; Hos 13:11 (|| אַף ), Hab 3:8 (|| id. ), Isa 9:18 ; Lam 2:2 ; Ps 90:9 ; Ps 90:11 + חֲרן אַף Isa 13:9 , || id. v Isa 13:13 ; Ps 78:49 (+ זַעַם ), Ps 85:4 אֵשׁ עֶבְרָתִי Ezek 21:36 (|| זַעַם ), Ezek 22:31 (|| id. ), v Ezek 22:21 ; Ezek 38:19 שֵׁבֶט עֶבְרָתוֺ Lam 3:1 (compare Prov 22:8 above); עַם עֶבְרָתִי Isa 10:6 (i.e. object of my rage), compare דּוֺר עֶבְרָתוֺ Jer 7:29 ׳ יוֺם עֶבְרַת י Zeph 1:18 day of ׳ י 's fury (coming judgment), so Ezek 7:19 (strike out Co Berthol , after ᵐ5 , as gloss from Zephaniah); so יוֺם עֶבְרָה Zeph 1:15 ; Prov 11:4 יוֺם עֲבָרוֺת Job 21:30 compare עֶבְרָה Prov 11:23 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5771')\">BDB5771</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5678')\">H5678</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5770')\">BDB5770</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5772')\">BDB5772</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֶבְרָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>overflow, arrogance, fury</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEn